4. CONTENT
================================================================================

Lumo TV is a generic media player. It does not provide, host, index, aggregate,
recommend or resell any audiovisual content, channel list or stream.

All content is supplied by the end user, from a source the end user configures
themselves and to which the end user warrants they hold the necessary rights.
Media is transmitted directly between the end user's device and the end user's
own provider; it does not transit through Lumo TV infrastructure.

Lumo TV bears no responsibility for the content accessed through the Software,
nor for the lawfulness of the sources configured by the end user.

